I'm sorry, Chase,
you're just gonna have to trust me.

568
01:14:51.607 --> 01:14:54.309
<i>You said that before. Why can't you come now?</i>

569
01:14:54.409 --> 01:14:57.746
I'm sorry, Chase,
you're just gonna have to trust me.

570
